data: {"text":"Email 1: Welcome\n\nSubject: Hi, friend! Your next happy break starts here 💛\nPreview: Colourful artisan cakes, made for celebrating.\n\nHeadline: Hi, friend! Let's make a moment sweeter.\n\nBody: We're so happy you're here! Cake Me makes artisan cheesecakes that turn everyday moments into little celebrations. Colourful, joyful and made to share with your people 🌟 Over the next two emails, we'll help you find the one that fits your moment.\n\nBullets: none\n\nCTA label: Meet the cakes (https://thecake-me.com)\n\nFooter note: Cake Me: sweetening the world, one slice at a time 💛\n[Unsubscribe and legal line to be supplied by Cake Me. It is"}

